{
"dur": 71.073,
"shots": [
{
"i": 1,
"start": 0.0,
"vo_start": 0.6,
"vo_end": 7.825,
"text": "Genghis Khan died in 1227 while fighting the Western Xia kingdom. Nobody knows exactly how, or where he is buried.",
"end": 8.1
},
{
"i": 2,
"start": 8.1,
"vo_start": 8.375,
"vo_end": 14.25,
"text": "His third son Ogedei became Great Khan, built a capital at Karakorum, and sent the armies further than ever.",
"end": 14.525
},
{
"i": 3,
"start": 14.525,
"vo_start": 14.8,
"vo_end": 24.44,
"text": "In 1236 his nephew Batu and the old general Subutai rode west. They crossed the Volga and took Russian cities in the depth of winter, using frozen rivers as roads.",
"end": 24.715
},
{
"i": 4,
"start": 24.715,
"vo_start": 24.99,
"vo_end": 28.55,
"text": "In December 1240 they took Kyiv, then the greatest city of the Rus.",
"end": 28.825
},
{
"i": 5,
"start": 28.825,
"vo_start": 29.1,
"vo_end": 33.945,
"text": "In April 1241 two Mongol armies struck Europe at once: one in Poland, one in Hungary.",
"end": 34.22
},
{
"i": 6,
"start": 34.22,
"vo_start": 34.495,
"vo_end": 38.694,
"text": "On the ninth of April, at Legnica, they beat an army of Polish and German knights.",
"end": 38.969
},
{
"i": 7,
"start": 38.969,
"vo_start": 39.244,
"vo_end": 48.841,
"text": "Two days later at Mohi, by the Sajo River, the Hungarian king camped inside a ring of wagons. The Mongols surrounded it, left one gap open, and cut down the men who fled through it.",
"end": 49.116
},
{
"i": 8,
"start": 49.116,
"vo_start": 49.391,
"vo_end": 53.067,
"text": "Western Europe had no army in the field that seemed able to stop them.",
"end": 53.342
},
{
"i": 9,
"start": 53.342,
"vo_start": 53.617,
"vo_end": 60.977,
"text": "Then, in December 1241, Ogedei died, far away in Mongolia. When the news arrived, Batu turned his armies back east.",
"end": 61.252
},
{
"i": 10,
"start": 61.252,
"vo_start": 61.527,
"vo_end": 70.123,
"text": "Historians still argue about why they never came back. Politics at home was part of it. Some think poor grazing land in Hungary was part of it too.",
"end": 71.073
}
],
